## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical integration of adapters in a multi-tenant infra context, focusing on isolation, policy routing, and real-world constraints (GPU, data, latency).

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant adapters and routing
- Injection points: attention first, optional FFN
- Quantization and PEFT variants trade-offs

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-implementation sketch for adapter injection
function applyAdapters(model, tenantId){
  const adapter = loadAdapter(tenantId);
  model.insertAdapterAt('attention', adapter);
  return model;
}
```

